A drop of a field the target requires. The backward lens of a rename, with
the derived entry overridden by a drop, leaves 0.0 without its field.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	before: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	after: string
}

forward: {
	after: input.before
}

backward: {
	after: drop
}
-- out/error --
0.0 requires before, and nothing produces it: map it in backward:
    history/0.0.thema:2:2
